<title>UK: Citibank sets call, put warrants on the Nikkei 225.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call, put warrants on the Nikkei 225.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued a total of 200 million American-style call and put warrants, in 10 equal tranches, on the Nikkei 225 index, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p>One unit of the index is controlled by 10 warrants.</p>
<p> PAYMENT DATE    29.JAN.97		 MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     SPOT REF     18,093 YEN</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	STRIKE	ISSUE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	 21,000	4.90 FFR   21.95 PCT    17.0 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	 19,000	8.10 FFR   14.75 PCT    10.3 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	 17,000     13.00 FFR    9.58 PCT     6.4 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT D	 23,000     28.20 FFR   -6.76 PCT     3.0 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT E	 21,000     20.10 FFR   -8.08 PCT     4.1 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT F	 19,000     19.20 FFR  -10.85 PCT     8.3 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT G	 17,000	7.95 FFR  -15.59 PCT    10.5 TIMES</p>
<p>(EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JAN.97 - 11.MAR.98)</p>
<p> CALL H	 24,000	3.00 FFR   36.25 PCT    27.7 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL I	 22,000	4.65 FFR   27.18 PCT    17.9 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL K	 20,000	7.10 FFR   19.07 PCT    11.7 TIMES</p>
<p>(EXERCISE PERIOD 30.JAN.97 - 11.SEP.98)</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
